@startuml UC04_Cancel_a_Ticket

title Sequence Diagram: UC-04 Cancel a Ticket

actor Passenger
participant PassengerWeb
participant BookingService
participant RefundService
participant InventorySvc
participant AllocationEngine
participant NotifAdapter

Passenger -> PassengerWeb : 1. requestCancel(PNR)
PassengerWeb -> BookingService : 2. cancelBooking(PNR)

alt past cutoff
    BookingService --> PassengerWeb : refuse with cutoff time
else within cutoff
    BookingService -> RefundService : 3. computeRefund(PNR, currentTime)
    RefundService --> BookingService : refund amount from slab table

    BookingService -> InventorySvc : 4. releaseBerth(PNR)
    InventorySvc --> BookingService : berth freed

    BookingService -> AllocationEngine : 5. promoteWaitlist(trainId, date, classId)
    AllocationEngine --> BookingService : promoted: 1 RAC up, 1 waitlist to RAC

    BookingService -> RefundService : 6. initiateRefund(txRef, amount)
    RefundService --> BookingService : RefundResult(refundRef, INITIATED)

    BookingService -> NotifAdapter : 7. sendCancelConfirm(PNR, amount)
    BookingService -> NotifAdapter : 8. sendPromotionNotify(promoted passengers)

    BookingService --> PassengerWeb : refund reference + amount
end

@enduml
